sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Device 1\nOwner/Admin
  participant B as Device 2\nManager/POS
  participant C as Device 3\nPharmacist/Inventory
  participant API as VPS Node.js API
  participant DB as MariaDB Tenant DB
  A->>API: Login + device signature + MFA
  API->>DB: Verify user, plan, device, branch
  DB-->>API: Approved session + permissions
  API-->>A: Access token + sync cursor
  B->>API: Login + device signature
  C->>API: Login + device signature
  B->>API: Sale request + idempotency key
  API->>DB: Permission check + transaction + row lock
  DB-->>API: Invoice committed + stock version
  API-->>B: Sale success + receipt
  API-->>A: Live event: sales and stock updated
  API-->>C: Live event: stock updated
  C->>API: Offline purchase queue after reconnect
  API->>DB: Validate tenant, device, permissions, versions
  DB-->>API: Commit or conflict result
  API-->>C: Sync result + new cursor
  API-->>A: Updated dashboard event
